eting Cloud (AMC) 构建高价值 Business 受众、潜在订阅者及新客（NTB）群组，以精细化提升亚马逊 B2B 广告表现。该工具公司指出，Amazon Business 买家单次购买量多 80% 且转化率高 3 倍，建议结合 Sponsored Products 出价调整与 DSP 受众推送来扩大收益。",{"_118":422},"2026-10-12T17:00:00.000Z","2026-10-12T19:00:27.132Z",[115,116,117],{"_111":421,"_112":422},[],"Michael Waters","Intentwise","jy5ntsnzt1sy2kvofnokeow1a","亚马逊创作者连接活动归因疑问","正在尝试亚马逊的创作者连接（Creator Connections）广告活动。怎么会出现有销售归因但没有点击归因的情况？我是不是在白白送钱啊？哈哈。",{"_118":454},"2026-10-12T17:06:32.000Z","2026-10-17T15:42:20.418Z",[115,117,116],[],{"_432":433,"_434":435,"_436":437,"_438":439,"_93":440,"_441":-5},"authorName","Michael Patrón","handle","michaelpatron0","avatarUrl","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","avatarSrcSet","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 48w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 96w",[442,443],"quoted",{"_97":98,"_99":449,"_101":450,"_103":451,"_105":452,"_107":453,"_109":-5,"_110":-5},{"_97":98,"_99":444,"_101":445,"_103":446,"_105":447,"_107":448,"_109":-5,"_110":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 720w",746,233,"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/missing.svg 720w",1771,447,"X · Michael Patrón","bf35yn9klnhgro6vvsxkh6y35","亚马逊广告预算向视频与DSP转移，TikTok自动化广告投放","媒体买家称亚马逊广告支出正从 Sponsored Products 转向 Amazon DSP、Prime Video 等上游渠道，Q2 广告收入同比增 26%。TikTok 推出 Smart+ 和 GMV Max 实现广告端全自动化，但保留人工购买确认。KnowBe4 数据显示 Prime Big Deal Days 前亚马逊冒充攻击激增 188%，卖家需警惕客户信任风险。",{"_118":471},"2026-10-15T00:00:00.000Z","2026-10-16T14:48:29.899Z",[115,116,117],40,{"_111":-5,"_112":470},[465],{"_97":98,"_99":466,"_101":467,"_103":468,"_105":469,"_107":462,"_109":-5,"_110":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/1de652430ffb0b84.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/1de652430ffb0b84.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/1de652430ffb0b84.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/1de652430ffb0b84.webp 720w",323,"SellerBites","SellerBites 亚马逊卖家周报","caopwyl5yz22h4db46q4cvm4d","卖家实测亚马逊SBV视频广告：CTR高2倍但ACOS高8%及优化建议","奋斗的青年分享其针对新品的亚马逊SBV视频广告实测结果，数据显示相比SP广告，SBV的点击率高2倍、订单多3倍，但ACOS高出8%。作者指出该测试受产品自然排名和上架初期流量影响，并总结了制作高转化率视频的最佳实践，包括前3秒出现人物可提升12% CTR、时长控制在15-30秒以及进行A/B测试等策略。文中还提及通过特定平台寻找达人合作制作视频素材的方法。",{"_118":212},"2026-10-15T05:01:26.814Z","2026-10-15T05:49:22.613Z",[115,116,117],{"_111":485,"_112":212},[481],{"_97":98,"_99":482,"_101":483,"_103":484,"_105":-5,"_107":-5,"_109":-5,"_110":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/343caf28eb0b8ca9.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/343caf28eb0b8ca9.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/343caf28eb0b8ca9.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/343caf28eb0b8ca9.webp 720w","奋斗的青年","bljtnnlvmkj2slb6v04kssxrf","BQool 对比亚马逊 PPC 软件与代运营服务：适用场景及差异分析","BQool 指出亚马逊 PPC 软件适合需高效执行已知策略的卖家，而代运营机构适合需要专家诊断问题或全权管理的卖家。文中引用 BQool 案例称某日本卖家经其团队优化后 ACoS 从 21% 降至 9%，销售额增长 1400%，该数据为厂商自述且未独立验证。",{"_118":503},"2026-10-16T08:35:05.000Z","2026-10-16T08:37:29.037Z",[115,161,117,116],{"_111":501,"_112":502},[495],{"_97":98,"_99":496,"_101":497,"_103":498,"_105":499,"_107":500,"_109":-5,"_110":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/dc4cb6a2aeca0575.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/dc4cb6a2aeca0575.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_img/dc4cb6a2aeca0575.webp 336w, /amznews-reading-preview/_img/dc4cb6a2aeca0575.webp 720w",780,439,"Daniel Wong","BQool","BQool · Amazon运营与广告","wtz7xyjv2nrsdsf7vq22mv1mv","SellerPlex 解析亚马逊广告代理服务内容、DSP 变化及 TACOS 评估标准","SellerPlex 指出亚马逊广告代理在卖家账户内管理 Sponsored Products/Brands/Display，并依据利润调整竞价。Amazon DSP 已整合进 Amazon Ads Agent，旧设置自动迁移且门槛降低。该机构自报数据显示，其管理的 38 个美国站点账户中位 TACOS 为 15%，建议以两个季度的 TACOS 趋势作为核心评估指标。",{"_118":520},"2026-10-16T14:07:44.000Z","2026-10-16T14:25:43.509Z",[115,213,117,116],{"_111":-5,"_112":519},[513],{"_97":98,"_99":514,"_101":515,"_103":516,"_105":517,"_107":518,"_109":-5,"_110":-5},"/amznews-reading-preview/_img/1f8ba6e5cdfc7c4c.webp","/amznews-reading-preview/_i